⚡🇵🇸 AFP reported that its photographer, Jaafar Ashtiyeh, 58, was attacked by armed Israeli settlers while documenting violence against Palestinian olive farmers in Aqraba, in the West Bank.

Ashtiyeh sustained injuries to his head and chest and was hospitalized. A dozen Israeli soldiers were located approximately 500 meters away but did not intervene.

